Also do not write the gentler version, which is the one that actually gets sent: a careful answer about food that mentions blood sugar or balance, names two or three kinds of food, then closes on the right approach depending on her individual situation. The caveat at the end does not undo the list in the middle. She follows what was named and forgets the sentence after it.

